{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve both checkpoint-token capitalization variants.** Replacing the prefix makes the previously accepted `Invalid Checkpoint Token...` message non-retryable. If that casing is returned, a recoverable stale-token race becomes a terminal execution failure. Keep the error-code/status guards, but compare this prefix case-insensitively and test both variants as retryable.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7vDh4R","finding_digest":"e6973ab4721a16ad421a1751149a1bedfe513f3b636c1e3ad32aa0a8fa336ac9","finding_id":"arf_v1_42ltvndsdilk2qq2c5irjgq35x","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/util/durableapierrorclassifier.java::classifyexception::checkpoint-token-case-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/util/durableapierrorclassifier.java::classifyexception::checkpoint-token-case-compatibility","line":51,"observation_digest":"a2e3c4b4ecd557ccce369882bbeeece064833a07b1dc408adc5d027313edb8c2","observation_id":"aro_v1_ulr4jnhm2vl4ztrwtcblx3xm4b","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/util/DurableApiErrorClassifier.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-15T00:01:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_e4q646rqxi5w2tjfflag7kfsrk","reviewed_base_sha":"7f1a73ca16308d31a1e5a270e504676caf890e0b","reviewed_head_sha":"d4c439f66361ebc1b17e1169c4222e680c0cfc97","reviewer":"codex","start_line":51,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":715},"record_id":"art_v1_2cbh2ui2iogcxdl2r4bvfpfp6l","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-15T00:01:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
